   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## WEB6 Upscale 2x\n4x-UltraSharp, then halved back to 2x so it stays sharp without over-sharpening. Set the scale to 1.0 for a full 4x. ~13 s at 1.5 MP in.\n\n- Hero at 2 MP (1936 px) becomes ~3870 px: enough for 1920 px at 2x DPR.\n- **Licence:** 4x-UltraSharp is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (non-commercial). Fine for boards and gate packets. For images that ship on a commercial site, switch the loader to a permissively licensed model (e.g. `RealESRGAN_x4plus`, BSD-3) once it is installed.\n- Textures from WEB5 stay seamless when upscaled."
   ]
  },
